00%" class="r-1sw70tt" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:Rtfer2:"><div data-rid="9bfede71-7c4b-4a63-ac31-a5d2ce9520f2" class="r-tatqgs"><div data-rid="a0a41775-5f10-4cda-b956-9a5b9c453160" class="r-1eo6ju5 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Absolutely! The Frido Posture Corrector was specifically designed to be slim and discreet, making it virtually invisible under standard work attire, casual clothing, and even most fitted shirts.</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="6d053a2f-2eb2-408b-9156-83f27a54ff8d" class="r-1l8rrb8"></div><div data-rid="314440a7-1a4c-4375-bdbb-42b6c3a407b9" class="r-1bnm0xd" data-replo-collapsible="true" data-state="closed"><div data-rid="ef575bb9-6629-49aa-8a6a-db0bf014d4eb" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="replo-:R1dfer2:" tabindex="0" role="button" class="r-1177xcw"><div data-rid="7b8d2aa9-f360-46e7-a235-7a41bf678e6d" class="r-odshjx alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0)">How do I know which size to order?</span></p></span></div><div data-rid="2fa896d8-c87f-44d5-8f3e-907084d4fd9d" class="r-1jo3uo3"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 16 16" role="presentation" style="width:var(--rsw, 100%);height:100%" class="r-xh2qre" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M1.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 1 .708 0L8 10.293l5.646-5.647a.5.5 0 0 1 .708.708l-6 6a.5.5 0 0 1-.708 0l-6-6a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.708"></path></svg></div></div><div class="replo-animated" hidden="" id="replo-:R1dfer2:"><div data-rid="ff3cbb60-6345-4e44-a573-73696a9720f4" class="r-1o1dzm0"><div data-rid="c3b362b2-a60d-4a7e-902c-a65c880b63ae" class="r-17rd3k9 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Measure around 